hur svare"},"title":["Śrī Nāma"],"author":["Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["    gāy gorā madhur svare","hare kṛṣṇa hare kṛṣṇa, kṛṣṇa kṛṣṇa hare hare","hare rāma hare rāma, rāma rāma hare hare"],"translation":["Kungs Gaurasundars saldā balsī dzied: “Harē Krišna, Harē Krišna, Krišna Krišna, Harē Harē, Harē Rāma, Harē Rāma, Rāma Rāma, Harē Harē”."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["gṛhe thāko, vane thāko, sadā ‘hari’ bole’ ḍāko,","sukhe duḥkhe bhulo nāko, vadane harinām kara re"],"translation":["Nav nozīmes, vai esi mājsaimnieks vai, atsacījies no pasaules, dzīvo vienatnē – vienmēr dziedi Kunga Svēto Vārdu! Laimē un nelaimē neaizmirsti piesaukt Svēto Vārdu, piepildot savas lūpas ar Harīnāmas nektāru."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["māyā-jāle baddha ho’ye, ācho miche kāja lo’ye,","ekhona o chetana peye, rādhā-mādhava-nām bolo re"],"translation":["Sapinies *majas* tīklos, tu esi kļuvis par ilūzijas vergu un esi veltīgi vergojis. Taču tagad, kad esi ieguvis cilvēcisko dzimšanu un apziņu, jel dziedi Rādhas-Mādhavas Vārdus!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["jīvana hoilo śeṣa, nā bhajile hṛṣīkeśa","bhaktivinod-upadeśa, ekbār nām-rase māto re"],"translation":["Tava dzīve nešaubīgi drīz beigsies, taču tu neesi pielūdzis Hrišīkēšu, jutekļu (maņu) Valdnieku. Bhaktivinoda lūdz tevi: pagaršo kaut reizi *nāma-rasu*, Svētā Vārda nektāru!"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-gay-gora","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-gaj-goura-1","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-gaj-goura","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-gay-gora-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-gay-gora","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gay-gaura-madhura-sware","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gai-gora-madxur","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Śrī-Nāma-06-30"},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/gay-gora-madhur-svare/","description":"Śrī Nāma — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Śrī Nāma. Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"gay-gora-madhur-svare"}}